## Product-Focused Image-to-Image Search (Clothes & Accessories)

This Colab-ready notebook builds product search that focuses on clothing/accessories in images and ignores people.

- **Detector**: Open-vocabulary (OWL-ViT) to localize clothing/products (e.g., pink swimsuit, thigh chain)
- **Embedding**: OpenCLIP ViT-L/14 image encoder
- **Index**: FAISS for fast nearest-neighbor retrieval

You can query with any image containing a person; the pipeline detects the product region (e.g., swimsuit) and retrieves visually similar available products from your dataset.
